   "text": "La Trobe College Australia - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nLa Trobe College Australia\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nLa Trobe College Australia has a presence in two of Australia’s largest and most sought-after cities - Melbourne at the main La Trobe University campus, and in the heart of Sydney as La Trobe University Sydney Campus. Through the La Trobe College’s pathway programs, students can undertake a range of specialized foundation courses or diplomas that help them complete the first part of their university degree in a supportive and tailored study environment. These pathway programs are the first step to achieving one of over 100 different degrees at La Trobe University, which is ranked among the top 1.1 per cent of universities in the world (Times Higher Education rankings 2020).CRICOS Provider Code: 03312D.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:02\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 07:20\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$34,389.00\nMin: A$22,419.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n12%\n2,570 of 21,663 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1964\nCampus(es)\nMelbourne\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MT-BnEWT6yo\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
